      "content": "<h3>remove(Object key), size(), isEmpty() and clear()</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Signature:</strong> <code>V remove(Object key);  boolean remove(Object key, Object value);  int size();  boolean isEmpty();  void clear()</code></li>\n<li><strong>Returns:</strong> old value / boolean / count</li>\n<li><strong>Time:</strong> O(1) average</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>For freshers:</strong> <code>remove(key)</code> deletes a pair and returns the old value (or null). The two-argument form deletes only when the value also matches. <code>clear()</code> empties the table.</p>\n<p><strong>For experienced developers:</strong> After <code>clear()</code> the internal array keeps its size; only the entries go.</p>",
